Subject: [PATCH] base: name every fingerprint surface once

Adds base/nanfu/surface.h, an enum listing each surface the kernel
composes or audits, with SurfaceName() returning the JSON key that
docs/fingerprint-probe.html emits for the same surface. A patch in this
series names the surface it changes in its own header, and a probe result
diffed against --fingerprint-explain needs no translation table.

Header only, included by nothing yet, for the same reason as 0001.

Nanfu-Patch-Applies-To: 155.0.8059.85
Nanfu-Patch-Promise: base/nanfu/surface.h::"webrtc_candidates"
Nanfu-Patch-Promise: base/nanfu/surface.h::kMaxValue = kNotificationPermission
Nanfu-Patch-Surfaces: all (index only)

diff --git a/base/nanfu/surface.h b/base/nanfu/surface.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..85926127e2b6171aa396c0e837bfcdfc3f150ed3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/base/nanfu/surface.h
@@ -0,0 +1,119 @@
